#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:17
msgid ""
"完整物理目录与相邻 README 以[源码合同入口](../explanation/source-map.md)为准。 厂家与 ISA "
"分组只改变构建期源码所有权；公共 include、CMake target 和装配中的 family "
"标识保持。公共等待／唤醒端口可跨后端连接，Task／Queue／join／静态控制块 仍使用后端专用 API；切换 RTOS "
"的产品显式适配其生命周期，不引入通用最大池。"
msgstr ""
"The [source contracts](../explanation/source-map.md) own the complete "
"physical layout and adjacent READMEs. Vendor and ISA grouping changes only "
"build-time source ownership; public includes, CMake targets and authored "
"family identifiers remain stable. The public wait/wake port can connect "
"across backends, while Task/Queue/join/static control blocks retain backend-"
"specific APIs. Products switching RTOS explicitly adapt their lifecycle; no "
"universal maximum pool is introduced."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:22
msgid ""
"SoC 按 controller kind/mode 组织 translation unit，同一实现可服务多个独立实例。 选入一个 UART "
"不会默认驻留所有 外设、RTOS 队列或最大对象池。启动与 system source 是显式 firmware 输入，不依靠 静态 archive "
"中未被引用的弱符号来拉入正确 reset/vector。强 provider IRQ 只随所选 实现进入镜像，未使用实现由 section GC 清除。"
msgstr ""
"SoC translation units are organized by controller kind/mode; one "
"implementation serves multiple independent instances. Selecting one UART "
"does not retain all peripherals, RTOS queues or maximum object pools. "
"Startup/system sources are explicit firmware inputs; correct reset/vectors "
"do not depend on unreferenced weak symbols in static archives. Strong "
"provider IRQs enter the image only with selected implementations; section GC"
" removes unused implementations."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:28
msgid ""
"CMake 从同一 resolved 结果读取选中的 controller kind/mode，仅查询选择事实； 源码集合仍由各家族 CMake "
"维护。未选择的驱动不参与编译，端点所需 base driver 按组合补齐。STM 空配置不编译外设驱动；GD 保留 system/timebase "
"所需的基础 SDK 源码。最终 section GC 继续消除未引用函数，编译裁剪与镜像裁剪分别验证。"
msgstr ""
"CMake reads selected controller kind/mode from the same resolved result, "
"querying selection facts only; each family's CMake still owns source sets. "
"Unselected drivers are not compiled, and endpoint base drivers are supplied "
"by composition. Empty STM configurations compile no peripheral drivers; GD "
"retains base SDK sources required by system/timebase. Final section GC "
"removes unreferenced functions. Compilation trimming and image trimming are "
"verified separately."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:33
msgid ""
"G474 的 HSE24/170 MHz 参考维护静态 GPIO、六 UART、SPI1/2、TIM3/4 PWM、IWDG 与 EXTI。独立 "
"acquisition 夹具选择 ADC1 bulb 单次／TIM6 有限 DMA、I2C1 和 物理 Flash。ADC DMA 仅开放 "
"SRAM1/2；CCM 的 CPU／DMA alias 仍作为同一物理 容量计数，当前策略不选入。每种模式只生成其状态、ring、block 扩展和 "
"IRQ 入口； 空装配不驻留这些外设。PA0/PA1 EXTI 各有调用者容量的事件环及撤回责任。 "
"失败构造对象逆序清理，撤销失败保留原时钟／引脚／状态；源码、模型或 ARM 链接 不建立参考 PCB、模拟时序、ThreadX G474 或物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"The G474 HSE24/170 MHz reference maintains static GPIO, six UARTs, SPI1/2, "
"TIM3/4 PWM, IWDG and EXTI. A separate acquisition fixture selects ADC1 bulb "
"shots/finite TIM6 DMA, I2C1 and physical Flash. ADC DMA admits SRAM1/2 only;"
" CCM CPU/DMA aliases still count as one physical capacity and are excluded "
"by the current policy. Each mode generates only its selected state, ring, "
"block extension and IRQ entries; an empty assembly retains none of these "
"peripherals. PA0/PA1 EXTI each have a caller-sized event ring and withdrawal"
" responsibility. Failed construction cleans up in reverse order; refused "
"withdrawal retains clock/pin/state ownership. Source, models and ARM linking"
" do not establish reference PCB, analog timing, ThreadX G474 or physical "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:41
msgid ""
"H743 与 U575 分别增加 M7／M33 的具体 SoC 装配。H743 维护 LDO、固定 HSI32／HSI64 × Cache "
"off/on、TIM2、PB0 与 USART3 PD8/PD9；UART 可选 IRQ bytes、 有限 TX DMA 或有限 RX DMA-"
"IDLE，RX 由 owner service 重启且有间隙。默认 AXI SRAM 之外可显式预算 D2 SRAM1；启动复制 DATA／清 "
"BSS，NOINIT 由调用者初始化，DMA 只接纳已初始化的所选域并再次检查 gate。Cache-on 仍要求完整独占 32-byte lines。"
" H743 的独立软件 Board 夹具另选择 SPI4、I2C1、ADC1、TIM3、EXTI、IWDG1 与 Cache-off 物理 "
"Flash。U575 默认 Platform 维护外部已确认的 TZEN=0、 SWAP_BANK=0、MSIS4 MHz、Cache "
"off、TIM2、PC7 与 USART1 PA9/PA10。 U575 的独立有限夹具增加 SPI1、I2C1、ADC4、TIM3、EXTI 与物理 "
"Flash；ADC 的外部 VDDA/ASV 与 GPIO 的 VDDIO2 准入仍由实际电源所有者负责。这两类 Platform 均维护 "
"裸机／FreeRTOS，不从芯片事实自动派生其他模式或 PCB 接线。 H743 在主 RAM 可写前执行独立的有界电源入口。U575 另有无 OS 的"
" TZEN=1 双域参考：两个 Runtime 镜像、冷归属 owner 与同步 CMSE GPIO gateway，独立于 TZEN=0 "
"factory。第二个窄 SG 入口复制最多八个 PC7 命令到单一 Secure slot，SERVICE "
"每次只推进一项，POLL／CANCEL／CONSUME 使用不回绕 ticket；返回后不保留 NS 指针， 不建立异步借用。两条 U575 "
"路径都不修改 option bytes，双域参考要求外部预先 完成其启动配置。精确范围见 [SoC 完善合同](../design/soc-"
"refinement.md) 与 [U575 双域合同](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)； "
"[初次执行记录](soc-refinement-verification.md) 保留历史资格， [扩展执行记录](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md) 单独记录后续证据。"
msgstr ""
"H743 and U575 add concrete M7/M33 SoC assemblies. H743 maintains LDO, fixed "
"HSI32/HSI64 with Cache off/on, TIM2, PB0 and USART3 PD8/PD9. UART selects "
"IRQ bytes, finite TX DMA or finite RX DMA-IDLE; owner service restarts RX "
"with gaps. D2 SRAM1 can be explicitly budgeted beside default AXI SRAM. "
"Startup copies DATA and clears BSS; callers initialize NOINIT, and DMA "
"admits only initialized selected domains after rechecking their gate. Cache-"
"on still requires complete exclusively owned 32-byte lines. A separate H743 "
"software Board fixture selects SPI4, I2C1, ADC1, TIM3, EXTI, IWDG1 and "
"Cache-off physical Flash. The default U575 Platform maintains externally "
"confirmed TZEN=0, SWAP_BANK=0, MSIS4 MHz, Cache off, TIM2, PC7 and USART1 "
"PA9/PA10. Its separate finite fixture adds SPI1, I2C1, ADC4, TIM3, EXTI and "
"physical Flash; the actual power owner remains responsible for external "
"VDDA/ASV and GPIO VDDIO2 admission. Both Platforms maintain "
"baremetal/FreeRTOS without deriving other modes or PCB wiring from chip "
"facts. H743 executes a separate bounded power entry before main RAM becomes "
"writable. U575 also has a no-OS TZEN=1 dual-world reference: two Runtime "
"images, a cold attribution owner and synchronous CMSE GPIO gateway, "
"independent of the TZEN=0 factory. A second narrow SG entry copies up to "
"eight PC7 commands into one Secure slot; SERVICE advances at most one item, "
"and POLL/CANCEL/CONSUME use nonwrapping tickets. No NS pointer survives "
"return and no asynchronous borrow is created. Neither U575 path writes "
"option bytes; external provisioning must establish the dual-world boot "
"state. See [SoC refinement](../design/soc-refinement.md) and [the U575 dual-"
"world contract](../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md). The [initial "
"record](soc-refinement-verification.md) retains historical qualification; "
"the [extension record](soc-extensions-verification.md) separately records "
"later evidence."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:62
msgid ""
"F103/GD303 通过私有 legacy 引擎复用实际兼容的 UART channel-DMA、I2C V1、ADC、 PWM 和半字 Flash "
"算法；家族层检查官方寄存器 ABI、时钟、IRQ 和内存事实。TX-only UART 状态不包含 duplex RX block 扩展，方法表和直接 "
"IRQ 按模式选入。F103 的 16-bit TIM2 要求 65.536 ms 内处理 overflow；GD303 使用 "
"TIMER1/TIMER4 硬件级联， 避免把最长 800 ms Flash 擦除停顿误当作可由单个低位 IRQ 补回。实际 timer carry、 "
"同 bank 取指停顿和内核 tick 丢失仍需实板测量；时间域不负责替内核补 tick。"
msgstr ""
"F103/GD303 reuse compatible UART channel-DMA, I2C V1, ADC, PWM and halfword "
"Flash algorithms through private legacy engines; each family checks official"
" register ABI, clocks, IRQs and memory facts. TX-only UART state excludes "
"the duplex RX-block extension; methods and direct IRQ entries are selected "
"by mode. F103's 16-bit TIM2 needs overflow service within 65.536 ms. GD303 "
"uses a TIMER1/TIMER4 hardware cascade rather than assuming one low-word IRQ "
"can recover a maximum 800 ms Flash erase stall. Actual timer carry, same-"
"bank fetch stalls and kernel tick loss still require physical measurements; "
"the time domain does not catch up kernel ticks."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:69
msgid ""
"Board 不复制 SoC 驱动。GD32 的 I2C/PWM/ADC/EXTI route、STM32 的高级控制器 route "
"可以在明确标为软件测试夹具的外部 Board 包中编译／链接；这不意味着三块参考 PCB 已核对相同 connector 和电气。默认 Board "
"仅绑定已有来源的路线。"
msgstr ""
"Boards do not duplicate SoC drivers. GD32 I2C/PWM/ADC/EXTI routes and STM32 "
"advanced-controller routes may compile/link in external Board packages "
"explicitly marked software fixtures; this does not mean the three reference "
"PCBs have matching verified connectors/electrical facts. Default Boards bind"
" only routes with existing provenance."

