#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:97
msgid ""
"一个 assembly 选择 Board、clock profile、OS backend、控制器实例、有限 mode、 容量、IRQ "
"优先级、endpoint 和预算。生成器只生成静态硬件装配，不生成任务、业务 代码或软件依赖图。未知键、失效输入、非法模式、引脚／IRQ／timer "
"冲突、越界容量 都会拒绝；失败重配置使旧 bundle 失效，不静默使用上一次成功结果。"
msgstr ""
"One assembly selects Board, clock profile, OS backend, controller instances,"
" bounded modes, capacities, IRQ priorities, endpoints and budgets. The "
"generator creates only static hardware assembly, not tasks, business code or"
" software dependency graphs. Unknown keys, invalid inputs/modes, "
"pin/IRQ/timer conflicts and out-of-range capacities are rejected. Failed "
"reconfiguration invalidates the old bundle instead of silently reusing a "
"previous success."

msgid ""
"SoC/Board 事实采用 JSON，平台装配只接受 schema-2 TOML。`AuthoredAssembly` "
"保存冻结的用户意图；`resolve_ir()` 严格校验事实、模式和资源后直接产生不可变 `ConfigurationIR`。生产 "
"resolver、factory 和 emitter 使用具名字段，不提供 Mapping 接口或保存第二份 `values` "
"决策副本。`to_dict()` 派生 `resolved.json` 供审计与独立产物检查，不能回填为配置；旧 schema-1 JSON "
"装配入口已删除。 历史证据仍保持原格式和只读校验，不建立当前代码资格。"
msgstr ""
"SoC/Board facts use JSON; platform assemblies accept only schema-2 TOML."
" `AuthoredAssembly` retains frozen user intent. After strict validation "
"of facts, modes and resources, `resolve_ir()` directly produces "
"immutable `ConfigurationIR`. Production resolver, factory and emitters "
"use named fields, without a Mapping interface or a second `values` copy "
"of decisions. `to_dict()` derives `resolved.json` for audits and "
"independent artifact checks; it cannot be fed back as configuration. The"
" legacy schema-1 JSON assembly entry has been removed. Historical "
"evidence retains its original format and read-only verification; it "
"grants no qualification to current code."

msgid ""
"IR 身份、预算和 controller／endpoint／CPU／kernel／resource options 使用冻结 "
"record；IRQ 为嵌套 record，ADC channels/sample times 为 tuple。原 JSON 硬件 "
"事实与按身份索引的只读 mapping 仍是明确的叶数据，resolver 内局部校验草稿也仍 可使用 dict；这不等于每个 JSON "
"字段都有名义类型。`source_fields` 只记录投影 字段存在性，不保存决策值副本。Python typed source epoch "
"为 2，JSON 投影仍为 schema 1；两者各自计代，不改变 MCU C factory 接口。"
msgstr ""
"IR identity, budgets and controller/endpoint/CPU/kernel/resource options"
" use frozen records; IRQ is a nested record, and ADC channels/sample "
"times are tuples. Original JSON hardware facts and identity-keyed "
"readonly mappings remain explicit leaf data, and local resolver "
"validation drafts may still use dictionaries. This does not give every "
"JSON field a nominal type. `source_fields` records only projection-field"
" presence, not duplicate decision values. Python typed source epoch is "
"2, while JSON projection remains schema 1; they have separate "
"generations and do not change MCU C factory interfaces."

msgid "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/configure/`（Native 为 `soc/native/configure/`）明确 拥有 ABI、mode→implementation、DMA 路线、trigger、共享 IRQ 与 CS 合同，以及 静态构造描述、IRQ 转发和系统时钟绑定。具体 C11 adapter 负责硬件准入、寄存器 读写与回读、prepare/start/stop、撤回和恢复；生成的 Platform 保留显式调用与 逆序清理，不在 Python 中维护硬件算法。公共 resolver 保留 schema、事实、 资源、输入身份与输出，公共 binding 编排 Nexus face 与统一生命周期进度。 新增 SoC 需显式登记真实 provider 模块并维护 CMake/SDK 必需文件；未知 family 和 mode 拒绝，不继承 Native 或 Cortex-M4 默认值。普通 Board 复用已有实现， 不复制驱动；文档矩阵不能反向决定配置。"
msgstr "`soc/<vendor>/<family>/configure/` (`soc/native/configure/` for Native) explicitly owns ABI, mode-to-implementation selection, DMA routes, triggers, shared IRQ and CS contracts, static construction descriptions, IRQ forwarding and system-clock bindings. Concrete C11 adapters own hardware admission, register access and readback, prepare/start/stop, withdrawal and recovery. Generated Platform code preserves explicit calls and reverse cleanup; Python does not maintain hardware algorithms. The common resolver owns schema, facts, resources, input identity and output; common bindings assemble Nexus faces and uniform lifecycle progress. New SoCs must explicitly register their real provider module and maintain required CMake/SDK files. Unknown families and modes are rejected without a Native or Cortex-M4 fallback. Ordinary Boards reuse existing implementations without copying drivers; documentation matrices cannot determine configuration."

msgid "显式 provider map 与共享 leaf 合同仍在 `tools/configure/providers/`，配置测试仍在 `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`。共享 IP 源码选编、配置包位置与物理资格 分别核对；本轮路径整理不扩大模式支持，实板状态仍为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "The explicit provider map and shared leaf contracts remain in `tools/configure/providers/`; configuration tests remain in `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`. Shared IP source selection, configuration package placement and physical qualification are reviewed separately. This layout refactor does not expand supported modes; physical status remains `not_executed`."

msgid "`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` 与 `ControllerIR.integration` 是现有冻结事实和资源计划 的具名视图，复用原 Flash／memory、resource claim、DMA lane、IRQ 和 clock 对象； 不增加 JSON／配置身份字段或另一套路由解析。F407 SPI 与成对 secondary-controller 路径已消费该 integration，其他构造仍可使用既有适配。名义 APB 频率不替代经复核 的 clock domain envelope。字段职责和新增料号检查见 [provider 接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md#keep-facts-and-admission-policy-distinct)。"
msgstr "`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` and `ControllerIR.integration` are named views of existing frozen facts and resource plans. They reuse the original Flash/memory, resource claim, DMA lane, IRQ and clock objects; they add neither JSON/configuration-identity fields nor another route resolver. F407 SPI and paired secondary-controller paths consume the integration, while other constructors can retain their existing adapters. A nominal APB frequency does not replace the reviewed clock-domain envelope. See the [provider porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md#keep-facts-and-admission-policy-distinct) for field responsibilities and new-part checks."


#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:116
msgid ""
"不可变 family descriptor 统一配置入口、依赖身份和 SDK 必需 payload；controller descriptor "
"复用精确寄存器基址、IRQ、DMA 和引脚绑定事实，生产 C 的 SDK 静态 断言仍独立核对。`clock.source`／`input_hz` 表达"
" HSE、HSI 或 MSIS 等真实来源； 旧 `hse_hz` 只在解析入口归一化，不为内部振荡器虚构外部晶振。复杂芯片用 "
"`dma_engines` 分别表达实际可达性，不用一个布尔值掩盖不同 DMA master 的差异。 这些是构建期事实，不新增运行时 "
"registry、查询层或第二份源码图。"
msgstr ""
"Immutable family descriptors unify configuration entry, dependency identity "
"and required SDK payloads. Controller descriptors reuse exact register "
"bases, IRQ, DMA and pin facts; production-C SDK static assertions "
"independently check them. `clock.source`/`input_hz` express real "
"HSE/HSI/MSIS sources; legacy `hse_hz` is normalized only at parsing, without"
" inventing external crystals for internal oscillators. Complex chips use "
"`dma_engines` for actual per-master reachability rather than one boolean "
"hiding differences. These are build-time facts, not a runtime registry/query"
" layer or second source graph."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:123
msgid ""
"CMake 中 `Nexus::Platform` 导出配置、typed factory 和不可变接口；SDK headers 和 provider "
"storage 只对实现与生成 binding TU 可见。公共消费路径没有厂商 SDK ABI。 外部 firmware 通过 "
"`nexus_add_firmware()` 显式装入 startup/system/linker 和资源校验。"
msgstr ""
"CMake `Nexus::Platform` exports configuration, typed factory and immutable "
"interfaces. SDK headers/provider storage are visible only to "
"implementation/generated binding TUs. Public consumption has no vendor-SDK "
"ABI. External firmware explicitly adds startup/system/linker/resource checks"
" through `nexus_add_firmware()`."

# CMSIS6 actual-POT delta; independent review pending.
msgid "七个 SoC family 的 CPU 头统一选用官方 CMSIS-Core v6.4.0 pin，Device、startup 及 HAL/LL 仍由各 family 的锁定供应商来源维护。内部 `nexus_cmsis_core` 和 `nexus_use_cmsis_core(target)` 归构建目标图拥有，与公共 `Nexus::Core` 中性机制 不同；普通公共消费路径不导出厂商 Core 头或类型。GD32F470 原导入中的旧 Core 字节与通知保留，实际选入的是共享来源，不能仅凭目录存在判断编译依赖。版本和 许可证身份见[供应商版本](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/vendors/VERSIONS.md)。这一依赖迁移不改变公共 Arch 的上下文、所有权与屏蔽恢复合同，不自动启用新的芯片、profile 或安全域； 实际 include 闭包、ARM 链接、移位 SDK 消费与物理资格分别验收。"
msgstr "The seven SoC family entries select the pinned official CMSIS-Core v6.4.0 CPU headers, while each family retains its locked vendor Device/startup and HAL/LL sources. The build target graph owns the internal `nexus_cmsis_core` and `nexus_use_cmsis_core(target)`, distinct from the public neutral `Nexus::Core` mechanisms. Ordinary public consumers do not inherit vendor Core headers or types. The old Core bytes and notices in the GD32F470 import remain; the selected source is shared, and directory presence alone does not establish a compiler dependency. See [vendor versions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/vendors/VERSIONS.md) for version and license identities. This dependency migration does not change public Arch context, ownership or mask-restoration contracts, or automatically enable a new chip, profile or security domain. Actual include closure, ARM links, relocated-SDK consumption and physical qualification have separate acceptance scopes."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:127
msgid "固定对象与执行"
msgstr "Fixed objects and execution"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:129
msgid ""
"CPU 原语、特权、中断屏蔽和 FreeRTOS 启动合同见 [Cortex-M 架构接入](cortex-m.md)。Arch "
"按编译期目标选择实现，不使用运行时 CPU factory；设备 typed factory 与共享多态方法表保持。F407／F470 的首发模式 和 "
"G474／H743／U575 的有限纵切片分别维护，九核 CPU 软件层的模型/编译不替代 具体 SoC 集成或物理验证。"
msgstr ""
"CPU primitives, privilege, interrupt masks and FreeRTOS startup contracts "
"are in [Cortex-M integration](cortex-m.md). Arch selects implementation at "
"compile time without a runtime CPU factory; device typed factories/shared "
"polymorphic tables remain. F407/F470 launch modes and limited G474/H743/U575"
" vertical slices are maintained separately. Nine-core CPU models/compilation"
" cannot replace concrete SoC integration or physical verification."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:135
msgid ""
"独立 CPU runtime 读取外部 `runtime.toml` 与显式 `cpu.json`，复用同一冻结 `CpuProfileIR` 和生产 "
"CMake targets。`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)` 导出 `Nexus::Runtime`，传递 "
"Config/ABI、Core、Arch、typed I/O face 与选定裸机/ FreeRTOS adapter；安装包用 "
"`find_package(Nexus REQUIRED COMPONENTS Runtime)` 开放相同入口。该模式没有 "
"SoC、Board、启动、链接脚本或 typed factory。具体 memory/clock/IRQ 资源、设备 "
"provider、安全策略及最终固件仍由外部工程实现。 九核的 FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/DWT/security/SAU "
"都是显式事实，合法组合和精确 kernel port 经解析器选择，不能靠 CMake cache 推断或覆盖。硬件与产品 qualification "
"仍独立；单区域 MPU/SAU 机制自身不提供用户 task 隔离或双世界 gateway。 U575 双域参考显式组合独立 SoC 归属 owner "
"和外部镜像分区，并不是 Runtime 或默认 Platform 自动生成的能力。"
msgstr ""
"Independent CPU runtime reads external `runtime.toml`/explicit `cpu.json`, "
"reusing frozen `CpuProfileIR` and production CMake targets. "
"`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)` exports `Nexus::Runtime` with Config/ABI, "
"Core, Arch, typed I/O faces and selected baremetal/FreeRTOS adapter. "
"Installed `find_package(Nexus REQUIRED COMPONENTS Runtime)` exposes the same"
" entry. There is no SoC/Board/startup/linker script/typed factory. External "
"projects implement actual memory/clock/IRQ resources, device providers, "
"security policy and final firmware. Nine-core "
"FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/DWT/security/SAU are explicit facts; the parser selects "
"legal combinations/exact kernel ports, never CMake-cache inference/override."
" Hardware/product qualification remains separate. Single-region MPU/SAU "
"mechanisms alone provide neither user-task isolation nor split-world "
"gateways. The U575 split-domain reference explicitly combines independent "
"SoC ownership and external image partitioning; Runtime/default Platform does"
" not generate it automatically."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:147
msgid ""
"ThreadX 是独立的真实内核后端，选入锁定的 Eclipse ThreadX Linux GNU 或 Cortex-M4 GNU port，不复用 "
"FreeRTOS 的配置字段。首批维护三块 F407/F470 Board、Native Linux 及明确的 M4 integer/M4F CPU "
"runtime；其余 Cortex-M port 拒绝。产品通过 `nx_threadx_kernel_enter()` 进入实际内核，只有真实 "
"`tx_application_define` 回调 允许启动前创建与回收任务。启动尝试后的异常返回保留全部效果并 fail-stop，不能 "
"回到启动前回收。Linux 使用实际 pthread 与 CLOCK_MONOTONIC kernel timer，但 调用者 stack 参数不是实际"
" host pthread 栈预算。详见 [ThreadX 接入](../design/threadx.md)。"
msgstr ""
"ThreadX is a separate actual-kernel backend, selecting locked Eclipse "
"ThreadX Linux GNU/Cortex-M4 GNU ports without reusing FreeRTOS configuration"
" fields. Initial scope maintains three F407/F470 Boards, Native Linux and "
"explicit M4-integer/M4F CPU runtime; other Cortex-M ports are rejected. "
"Products enter the kernel with `nx_threadx_kernel_enter()`. Only real "
"`tx_application_define` permits prestart task creation/reclamation. Abnormal"
" return after a start attempt retains all effects and fail-stops; it cannot "
"restore prestart reclamation. Linux uses actual pthreads/CLOCK_MONOTONIC "
"kernel timers, but caller stack parameters are not actual host-pthread stack"
" budgets. See [ThreadX integration](../design/threadx.md)."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:156
msgid ""
"当前恢复 factory＋多态接口骨架，生成阶段完成实例构造。每类接口 face 只有 `const ops*` 和 `context*`；face "
"与操作表只读，provider 可变状态及按实例选择的 buffer 独立静态存储。方法接收自己的 context，不通过操作表地址推断实例。"
msgstr ""
"The factory/polymorphic skeleton is restored, with construction completed "
"during generation. Each interface face has only `const ops*`/`context*`. "
"Faces/operation tables are read-only; mutable provider state and selected "
"per-instance buffers use independent static storage. Methods receive their "
"own context rather than infer instances from operation-table addresses."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:160
msgid ""
"生成 `nexus_factory.h` 和 assembly-local ID。`nx_factory_uart()` 等 typed 函数 "
"只返回已存在对象：不申请堆、不启硬件、不查字符串、不加锁。非法 ID 返回 NULL； 取得对象与 "
"`nx_platform_start()`、请求借用和停止分别执行。静态句柄不是可撤销 session，停机前仍必须结清调用者、IRQ、owner "
"与通知发布者。"
msgstr ""
"Generated `nexus_factory.h` defines assembly-local IDs. Typed functions such"
" as `nx_factory_uart()` return existing objects only: no heap, hardware "
"start, string lookup or locks. Invalid IDs return NULL. Lookup, "
"`nx_platform_start()`, request borrow and stop are separate actions. Static "
"handles are not revocable sessions; shutdown must settle callers, IRQs, "
"owners and notification publishers."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:165
msgid ""
"factory 默认 ID 按类命名并以 `uint16_t` 表达；C typedef 不阻止把另一个类的数值 传入。可显式选择按类 struct "
"reference，防止正常调用混用 ID，或选入只读能力查询； 两者仍返回同一静态对象，不增加运行时注册或构造。能力查询描述已选择的有限模式， "
"不代替当前状态、PCB 电气或请求 admission。ID 只属于当前 assembly，不作为跨版本 持久化编号。start/stop 由外部单一 "
"执行者串行调用，没有隐藏平台锁；公共 I/O 不统一检查全局 started 状态，启动 失败后的业务退出与清理推进由调用合同约束。stop "
"可先撤回部分实例再返回 BUSY， 不得把 BUSY 解释成恢复完整运行状态。"
msgstr ""
"Default factory IDs are class-named `uint16_t`; C typedefs do not prevent "
"passing another class's numeric value. Optional class-specific struct "
"references prevent ordinary ID mixing, or read-only capability queries may "
"be selected. Both return the same static objects without runtime "
"registration/construction. Capability queries describe selected bounded "
"modes, not current state, PCB electrical facts or admission. IDs are local "
"to the current assembly, not persistent cross-version numbers. One external "
"executor serializes start/stop without hidden platform locks. Public I/O has"
" no uniform global-started check; contracts govern business exit/cleanup "
"after start failure. Stop may withdraw some instances before returning BUSY;"
" BUSY does not restore complete running state."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:174
msgid ""
"冷启动先拒绝可观察到的外部 owner。GPIO 装配先观察全部选中 bank 的 gate， 再检查全部选中 pin 的 "
"mode/lock，最后才保存租约并修改 pin；不能先改一个 bank 再因另一个 bank 冲突而假称未产生效果。控制器路线和 endpoint "
"CS 都属于 同一次检查。共享 bank 的未选中 pin 保持外部所有权。"
msgstr ""
"Cold startup first rejects observable external owners. GPIO assembly "
"observes every selected bank gate, then every selected pin mode/lock, before"
" saving leases/modifying pins; it cannot modify one bank then claim no "
"effects on another-bank conflict. Controller routes and endpoint CS share "
"this check. Unselected pins in shared banks remain externally owned."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:179
msgid ""
"H743 从可信复位或已成功完成自有 clean/disable 的冷状态建立固定时钟和 Cache 配置，不能仅凭 CCR 关闭位认领未知 "
"bootloader 状态。Arch 冷 Cache 控制对象 保留已取得的 I/D Cache 与 selector 恢复责任；当前机制只维护 "
"M7。有限 UART DMA 只接纳选中且已初始化的 AXI SRAM 或显式预算的 D2 SRAM1；未选中的域、 TCM 与未就绪的 SRAM1 "
"gate 均被拒绝。Cache on 时要求完整 32-byte line 的独占借用。TX 提交先取得 PREPARING 借用，再在长中断屏蔽区外 "
"clean；取消不得在准备结束前发布 SETTLED。 平台停止先排空 provider，再撤回 TIM2、clean/disable "
"Cache，最后恢复 HSI divider。任何未清理效果继续由原 owner 持有；这些是冷生命周期，不是运行中变频。"
msgstr ""
"H743 establishes fixed clocks/Cache from trusted reset or successfully "
"completed owned clean/disable, never claiming unknown bootloader state from "
"disabled CCR bits alone. Arch cold-Cache control retains owned I/D Cache and"
" selector-recovery responsibility; only M7 is maintained. Finite UART DMA "
"accepts only selected, initialized AXI SRAM or explicitly budgeted D2 SRAM1;"
" unselected domains, TCM and an unready SRAM1 gate are rejected. Cache on "
"requires exclusive complete 32-byte-line borrow. TX submission acquires "
"PREPARING borrow before cleaning outside a long IRQ-masked section; "
"cancellation cannot publish SETTLED before preparation ends. Platform stop "
"drains providers, withdraws TIM2, cleans/disables Cache and restores the HSI"
" divider in that order. Uncleared effects remain with original owners. This "
"is cold lifecycle, not live frequency scaling."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:188
msgid ""
"驱动自己的 GPIO stop 保持声明的 safe idle。完整 Platform stop 只有在所有 "
"IRQ／DMA／调用者引用排空后，才恢复原来的选中 pin 租约并释放 gate；恢复读回 失败仍保留对应清理责任。因此完整 Platform "
"释放不承诺持续主动驱动产品安全 电平。产品需要持续驱动时，应保留平台 owner，或先按外部电源／安全策略退出。 "
"这是资源所有权边界，不是平台内置的产品停机政策。"
msgstr ""
"Driver GPIO stop preserves declared safe idle. Full Platform stop restores "
"selected-pin leases/releases gates only after all IRQ/DMA/caller references "
"drain; failed restoration readback retains cleanup responsibility. Full "
"release therefore does not promise active product-safe levels indefinitely. "
"Products needing continued drive retain the platform owner or first exit "
"under external power/safety policy. This is resource ownership, not built-in"
" product shutdown policy."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:194
msgid ""
"timebase 只在成功启动后发布有效 epoch。启动先排除旧 UIF，再观察 UG 产生的 新更新；运行期 ACK 拒绝时不累加 "
"epoch，而是使时间失效并有界撤回中断源。 无论中断源隔离是否成功，都保留终止路径的中断屏蔽并调用故障观察端口；观察者 "
"返回后仍停机，不以无效零时间继续运行 deadline consumer，也不释放 request 或低功耗借用。产品可提供独立审查的非返回恢复；正常 "
"stop/restart 或清理重试 不能恢复这条终止路径。读取在同一掩码区内再次确认 epoch 有效，避免 IRQ 在 读取入口间隙使时间失效。旧 "
"deadline 不能跨停机、失败或重启继续使用。"
msgstr ""
"Timebase publishes a valid epoch only after successful start. Startup "
"excludes old UIF before observing a new UG update. Runtime ACK refusal "
"invalidates time and boundedly withdraws interrupt sources instead of "
"incrementing epoch. Regardless of isolation success, it retains terminal "
"interrupt masking and calls fault observation; returned observers still "
"halt, without zero-time deadline processing or releasing request/low-power "
"borrows. Products may provide separately reviewed nonreturning recovery. "
"Normal stop/restart/cleanup retries cannot recover this terminal path. Reads"
" recheck epoch validity under the same mask to prevent entry-gap IRQ "
"invalidation. Old deadlines cannot cross stop/failure/restart."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:202
msgid ""
"SPI/I2C controller factory 返回真实控制器，device factory 返回 CS/address 端点。一个 "
"controller 仲裁所有子端点；恢复属于 controller，不借用第一个端点 来冒充总线。不同 provider "
"的实例可在同一镜像中共享公共接口，各自保存操作表 与状态。Native 生成对象不再将多个名字绑定到一个全局模型。"
msgstr ""
"SPI/I2C controller factories return actual controllers; device factories "
"return CS/address endpoints. A controller arbitrates all children and owns "
"recovery, rather than borrowing the first endpoint as a bus alias. Different"
" providers share public interfaces within one image but retain their own "
"tables/state. Native generated objects no longer bind multiple names to one "
"global model."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:207
msgid ""
"公共函数做有界检查并调用共享表；provider 内部可以直接调用自己的实现，避免在 "
"寄存器热路径反复多态分派。组件通过公共合同接入，应用角色、任务与恢复策略仍由 外部工程拥有。编译选中某实例不代表其硬件已经启动或请求已经完成。"
msgstr ""
"Public functions do bounded validation and shared-table calls. Providers may"
" directly call their own implementation to avoid repeated dispatch in "
"register hot paths. Components use public contracts; external projects own "
"application roles/tasks/recovery. Compile-time instance selection means "
"neither started hardware nor completed requests."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:211
msgid ""
"生成器的私有对象按 port、endpoint、CS、buffer 和平台状态分开命名，避免合法 实例 ID 与内部辅助对象共用存储。设备字段按实际 "
"transport 校验；I2C endpoint 只声明地址，不接受无效的 SPI mode、频率或通用 capacity。`devices` "
"当前生成 总线端点，`components` 选择代码库；器件和 owner 实例仍由外部应用显式构造。"
msgstr ""
"Private generated objects are named separately by "
"port/endpoint/CS/buffer/platform state, preventing legal IDs from sharing "
"storage with helpers. Device fields are transport-validated. I2C endpoints "
"declare addresses, rejecting irrelevant SPI mode/frequency/generic capacity."
" `devices` generates bus endpoints and `components` selects libraries; "
"applications explicitly construct device/owner instances."

