msgid ""
"拒绝 producer→保持 executor drain→结清 borrow/通知发布者→join→逆序释放接口；仍运行的内核保留 "
"clock/Tick，产品决定 park 或 reset"
msgstr ""
"Reject producers→keep executor draining→settle borrows/notification "
"publishers→join→reverse interface release; running kernels retain clock/Tick"
" and products choose park/reset"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:228
msgid ""
"Flash geometry 的 `program_flags` 将 ECC 新擦除前提暴露给调用者。要求 fresh erase "
"的单元在一次脉冲后不可仅凭 FF 读回重用；失败／中断后重新擦除，全 FF 输入不发脉冲。 "
"每个已经启动的脉冲先取得新完成证据并实际排空，再返回或启动下一脉冲。deadline 不能中断硬件脉冲。供电声明、可写 "
"region、执行停顿、watchdog 与掉电恢复属于产品。"
msgstr ""
"Flash geometry `program_flags` exposes ECC fresh-erase prerequisites to "
"callers. A unit requiring fresh erase cannot be reused after a pulse merely "
"because reads return FF. Failed/interrupted pulses require another erase; "
"all-FF input issues no pulse. Every started pulse must obtain fresh "
"completion evidence and actually drain before return or another pulse. A "
"deadline cannot interrupt a hardware pulse. Products own supply "
"declarations, writable regions, execution stalls, watchdog and power-loss "
"recovery."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:233
msgid ""
"CAN 使用真实三邮箱和共享 filter domain；USB FS 使用显式 endpoint/FIFO/event 容量、PIO packet "
"loan 和独立 48 MHz owner；Ethernet 使用 caller-sized normal descriptor ring、RX "
"loan 和 MDIO 窄端口。它们没有内置协议栈或产品工作者。 timer capture 与 complementary PWM 分离普通 "
"PWM，拥有精确 timer/IRQ/break 资源。SoC 实现、配置可选择路线、Board 授权和实板测量分别核验，不能从公共类型 "
"的存在推断某个参考 PCB 已完整接入。具体范围见[支持说明](support.md)。"
msgstr ""
"CAN uses three real mailboxes/shared filter domain. USB FS uses explicit "
"endpoint/FIFO/event capacities, PIO packet loans and a separate 48 MHz "
"owner. Ethernet uses caller-sized normal descriptor rings, RX loans and a "
"narrow MDIO port. None contains protocol stacks/product workers. "
"Capture/complementary PWM are separate from ordinary PWM and own exact "
"timer/IRQ/break resources. SoC implementation, selectable routes, Board "
"authorization and physical measurements are independently verified; public "
"types alone cannot prove complete reference-PCB integration. See "
"[support](support.md)."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:240
msgid ""
"可选 `UserIoBroker` 只实现被特权 kernel gateway 调用的 scalar GPIO read/set-reset "
"admission。调用者提供真实 principal、memory pin/copy/unpin 与有界策略；用户消息 不能选择指针、MMIO "
"或信任身份。release 失败保留 mapping，cleanup 不重放 GPIO。 U575 独立无 OS 参考通过真实 SG 接入一个固定 "
"NonSecure-world principal，保留 并屏蔽 NS 中断，在静态归属和无并发 master 的前提下同步 pin/copy；输出跨度"
" 预验证成功后才允许 GPIO 效果。CMSE 范围检查只是权限观察，不独自保证借用。 没有通用 SVC、多任务 userspace 或异步用户 DMA"
" transport；软件模型和 ARM 指令／布局门禁不建立物理隔离或电气安全资格。"
msgstr ""
"Optional `UserIoBroker` admits only scalar GPIO read/set-reset through a "
"privileged kernel gateway. Callers provide actual principals, memory "
"pin/copy/unpin and bounded policy; user messages cannot select "
"pointers/MMIO/trusted identity. Failed release retains mapping; cleanup does"
" not replay GPIO. The independent OS-free U575 reference uses real SG for "
"one fixed NonSecure-world principal, retains/masks NS IRQs and synchronously"
" pins/copies under static attribution/no concurrent masters. Output-span "
"prevalidation precedes GPIO effects. CMSE range checks observe permissions "
"but do not alone guarantee borrowing. No generic SVC, multitasking userspace"
" or asynchronous user-DMA transport is provided. Models/ARM "
"instruction/layout gates confer no physical-isolation/electrical-safety "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:249
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 的 `lowpower_port = \"timebase\"` 显式选入 F407/GD470 私有浅 Sleep 定时器 "
"适配；默认 `custom` 保持应用端口或弱 NULL 行为。所选实际 getter 验证固定 PLL、 timebase 与 IRQ "
"状态，不修复未知配置。共享 timer 保留 monotonic overflow，额外 compare channel 只提供 wake "
"alarm；源撤回失败保留 loan 并 fail-stop。没有动态 clock、STOP/deep sleep 或默认低功耗 "
"worker。软件量化相位模型不等于实测功耗和 时序。详见[浅睡眠合同](../design/timebase-lowpower.md)。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS `lowpower_port = \"timebase\"` explicitly selects F407/GD470 "
"private shallow-Sleep timer adaptation; default `custom` retains "
"application-port/weak-NULL behavior. The actual getter validates fixed "
"PLL/timebase/IRQ state without repairing unknown configuration. Shared "
"timers retain monotonic overflow; extra compare channels supply wake alarms "
"only. Failed source withdrawal retains loans and fail-stops. There is no "
"dynamic clock, STOP/deep sleep or default low-power worker. Software "
"quantization-phase models are not measured power/timing. See [shallow-sleep "
"contract](../design/timebase-lowpower.md)."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:256
msgid ""
"UART `REJECTED` 不借用 request 或 buffer；`ACCEPTED` 借用到 acquire-observed "
"`SETTLED`。provider 先 detach，再 release-publish，之后不能读取 request。取消与 "
"超时不能提前释放借用；无法证明 drain 的情况进入 `QUARANTINED`，保留执行／恢复 责任。TC IRQ 观察时判绝对期限，后到 "
"service 不覆盖较早的完成事实。"
msgstr ""
"UART `REJECTED` borrows no request/buffer; `ACCEPTED` borrows until acquire-"
"observed `SETTLED`. Providers detach before release-publication and cannot "
"read requests afterward. Cancellation/timeout cannot release early. Unproven"
" drain enters `QUARANTINED` and retains execution/recovery responsibility. "
"TC-IRQ observation checks the absolute deadline; later service cannot "
"overwrite earlier completion facts."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:261
msgid ""
"STM32 取消保留到实际 TC drain；GD32 可用受控 USART reset 终止 wire interval， 未观察 TC 时保守 "
"count=0，并产生 RX loss。两者都不把写入 DR/DATA 的数量当作 完整发送字节。错误-only RX 和 loss marker 带 "
"`NO_BYTE`，不能消费旧寄存器数据。"
msgstr ""
"STM32 cancellation retains until actual TC drain. GD32 may terminate wire "
"intervals by controlled USART reset; without observed TC, count=0 "
"conservatively and RX loss results. Neither counts DR/DATA writes as "
"completely sent bytes. Error-only RX/loss markers have `NO_BYTE` and cannot "
"consume stale register data."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:265
msgid "性能与空间"
msgstr "Performance and space"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:267
msgid ""
"默认 C11 路径无 heap、运行时 registry、字符串查找、隐藏 worker、mandatory OS lock 或 闲置 DMA/copy"
" pool。RX/EXTI queue、OS object、owner slot 和组件 workspace 按 选择的实例配置分配。IRQ "
"只搬运有界事实，批量读取采用短临界区，ring 热路径不做 可避免的动态除法。"
msgstr ""
"Default C11 paths have no heap/runtime registry/string lookup/hidden "
"worker/mandatory OS lock/idle DMA-copy pool. RX/EXTI queues, OS objects, "
"owner slots and component workspace are sized to selected instances. IRQs "
"move bounded facts; bulk reads use short critical sections and ring hot "
"paths avoid unnecessary dynamic division."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:272
msgid ""
"资源工具计算真实 ELF 的 Flash LOAD/footprint、每个物理 RAM 域、MSP、heap 和 未使用 provider 的 "
"GC。O2/Os/O3 与 LTO 的选择依据相同 workload 的实测，不凭 源码行数推断效率。原生测试耗时、汇编数量和真实 MCU "
"cycles/latency 分开；当前 无实板，不能承诺“最低 cycles”或已完成物理时序预算。"
msgstr ""
"Resource tools calculate actual ELF Flash LOAD/footprint, each physical RAM "
"domain, MSP, heap and unused-provider GC. O2/Os/O3/LTO selection uses "
"measurements on the same workload, not source-line counts. Host-test time, "
"assembly counts and actual MCU cycles/latency are separate. With no "
"hardware, minimum cycles/completed physical timing budgets cannot be "
"promised."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:277
msgid ""
"固定容量也要测量最坏临界区。Owner admission 使用 free-head 链，提交与可复用 slot 归还为 O(1)，epoch 耗尽的 "
"slot 永久退休。stream 用 outstanding 记录 FILLING/READY/BORROWED 总借用，stop 判断为 "
"O(1)；失败或重复操作不改变计数。 每个 Owner 和 stream 逻辑上增加一个 `size_t`，不增加 per-slot 存储。实际 "
"Cortex-M4 ARM 编译中 Owner 控制对象为 80→84 B，stream 为 32→40 B，后者包含 64-bit epoch "
"对齐带来的 padding；slot 大小仍为 48/40 B。冷初始化仍需 构建链、清零和校验 block 重叠，重叠校验为 "
"O(n²)，发生在启动前无 IRQ guard。 这些复杂度不证明实际 cycles 或 IRQ latency，须以同一 ELF 测量。 默认 "
"Owner FIFO 不提供优先级抢占或 deadline 排序；应用必须预算事务长度、 service 间隔及 quarantine "
"对后续请求的影响。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed capacities still require worst-case critical-section measurement. "
"Owner admission uses a free-head chain; submission/reusable-slot return are "
"O(1); exhausted-epoch slots retire permanently. Streams count "
"FILLING/READY/BORROWED through outstanding, making stop checks O(1); "
"failures/duplicates preserve counts. Each Owner/stream logically adds one "
"`size_t`, not per-slot storage. Actual Cortex-M4 compilation changes Owner "
"control 80→84 B and stream 32→40 B, including 64-bit-epoch padding; slots "
"remain 48/40 B. Cold initialization builds chains/zeros/checks overlap; "
"overlap checks are O(n²), before startup without IRQ guards. Complexity does"
" not prove cycles/IRQ latency; measure the same ELF. Default FIFO provides "
"no priority preemption/deadline ordering; applications budget transaction "
"lengths, service intervals and quarantine effects on later requests."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:288
msgid ""
"`tools/measurement/interfaces.py` 从实际 ELF 审计保留的 face 与操作表。非 LTO ARM face 为 8"
" bytes Flash／0 bytes RAM，表按 provider 共享；独立状态另外核算。 简单 LTO workload 可能消除整个 "
"face／表，这不是任意应用都可继承的保证。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/measurement/interfaces.py` audits retained faces/operation tables in "
"actual ELFs. Non-LTO ARM faces occupy 8 bytes Flash/0 bytes RAM; providers "
"share tables and independent state is accounted separately. Simple LTO "
"workloads may remove entire faces/tables; arbitrary applications do not "
"inherit that guarantee."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:292
msgid "测试与新版本资格"
msgstr "Testing and new-version qualification"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:294
msgid ""
"主机新增合同使用固定版本 GoogleTest/GoogleMock，固件仍是 C11；测试框架、C++ runtime 和依赖 archive 不进入"
" MCU 镜像。保留已有生产 TU 的 C 寄存器/故障回归， 新增 mock 只替换硬件交互，不替换被测 owner、dispatch 或生成器。"
msgstr ""
"New host contracts use pinned GoogleTest/GoogleMock; firmware stays C11. "
"Framework/C++ runtime/dependency archives do not enter MCU images. Existing "
"production-TU C register/fault regressions remain; new mocks replace "
"hardware interaction, not owners/dispatch/generators under test."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:298
msgid ""
"TDD 按 Red→Green→Refactor 实施，新增行为先保留失败证据。commit hook 实际执行 测试并验证全量发现的用例、未过滤的新 "
"XML 和返回码；机械门禁只能证明当前执行， 不能证明所有开发者的历史编辑顺序。代码格式与反斜线 Doxygen 沿用既有规则。"
msgstr ""
"TDD follows Red→Green→Refactor and retains failure evidence before new "
"behavior. Commit hooks actually execute tests and validate complete "
"discovery, fresh unfiltered XML and exits. Mechanical gates prove current "
"execution, not every developer's historical editing order. "
"Formatting/backslash Doxygen retain existing rules."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/architecture.md:302
msgid ""
"本轮 factory/TOML/多态和 SoC 迭代不能继承此前候选的资格。 [初次 SoC 执行记录](soc-refinement-"
"verification.md) 绑定其历史 code revision， 不覆盖后续扩展；[扩展执行记录](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md) 独立绑定对应 源码、执行结果和原始证据。主机门禁、ARM 矩阵、安装 SDK、外部示例与离线 "
"复现各自核验，文档提交不替换被测 code 身份。新候选仍有独立退出条件；全部实板 尚未接入，物理结果保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"This factory/TOML/polymorphic/SoC iteration inherits no previous-candidate "
"qualification. [Initial SoC execution](soc-refinement-verification.md) binds"
" historical code revision and covers no later extension. [Extension "
"execution](soc-extensions-verification.md) independently binds corresponding"
" source/results/raw evidence. Host gates, ARM matrices, installed SDK, "
"external examples and offline reproduction are verified separately; "
"documentation does not replace tested-code identity. New candidates have "
"independent exit conditions. No hardware is connected; physical results "
"remain `not_executed`."
